5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Let's make this place super clean! I want to know how other people do it. Maybe we can find a cool idea!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree we need a fresh start. I'm a bit worried about the costs, though. We should check the finances first.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's keep our heads. It's not just about the bins, but how we'll actually get along once the dust settles.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"Oh, don't be such a killjoy, Shunichi! Let's just find something that looks good and doesn't make us suffer.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need a logical approach. I want to ensure the burden is distributed fairly among all five households, not just a few.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, money is boring! Let's look at the other neighborhoods! I bet they have something fancy.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"It might be boring, Rin, but it's important. I want to make sure everyone can afford the new arrangement.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, ""fairly"" is a subjective term. I suggest we look at the actual complaints to see where the friction is.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'm with Asuka on the burden part. I've seen too many people burn out doing all the work here.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the complaint log is a start, but we need objective data on the physical space and the current costs.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm going to check out the station block! It sounds like an adventure!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the ledger and the subsidies. We need to know what we're working with financially.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll handle the complaint log and the meeting minutes. I want to see exactly who is fighting over what.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'll check the supervised mornings and the truck arrival times. I want to know exactly how much time this takes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the measurements of the frontages and the block ledger. We must verify the spatial reality.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
