33,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"I went to the station block! It looked cool, but it smelled really, really bad! Like old socks in the sun!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear. I found that we're spending quite a bit on small things every year, and the initial cost for shelters is high.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Interesting. It seems the complaints are heavily skewed toward one person. A classic case of ""not in my backyard.""","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,I've got the numbers. It's not just a few minutes; it's a real time-sink if you're the one managing the schedule.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The frontage measurements are revealing. It is physically impossible for some of us to host the point without blocking access.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, fifty minutes is a long time! I could play a whole game of tag in that time!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, if the space is limited, we might need a more expensive, compact solution. But can we all afford that?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, money is a tool, not the goal. If we spend more to stop the bickering, it's a bargain.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"Exactly! But who is going to manage the ""compact solution""? I'm not volunteering to be the neighborhood secretary again.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"The ledger confirms that the current ""informal"" system is actually costing us money in maintenance. It's inefficient.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want a smelly house! Let's not do the bin house thing. It's a trap!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried that a high upfront cost, even with a subsidy, might be too much for some of our neighbors.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, a ""trap"" is exactly what we have now. We need a system that doesn't rely on one person's patience.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, you're speaking my language. If we can automate the schedule or make it a strict rotation, I'm in.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,A rotation is only fair if the physical burden is equal. We cannot simply rotate a bin to a narrow frontage.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,Let's just pick the one that's the most fun! Or the one that smells the least!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I think we should prioritize a balance between the cost and the long-term maintenance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's see the options. I'm looking for the one that minimizes the chance of us stopping speaking to each other.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"As long as it doesn't end up being ""whoever answers the phone first,"" I'll vote for almost anything.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will vote for the option that explicitly addresses the spatial inequality of our frontages.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
