60,3,1,talk,Rin,,I don't like the enclosure! I saw the other one and it was stinky! I vote for the moving one!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"The enclosure is expensive, but it might save us money on those yearly maintenance costs I found in the ledger.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Rotating the location is a recipe for disaster. We'll just be moving the argument from one house to another.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"@Rin, rotating the location just means we'll be arguing about whose turn it is to move the bins. No thanks.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option B is logically flawed. As I noted, some frontages cannot physically accommodate the point without obstructing the public way.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"But moving it is like a game! @Asuka, can't we just move it a little bit?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, if we go with the managed hours, will that actually stop the complaints, or just change them?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,It's a compromise. It acknowledges the location is fixed but shares the burden of supervision. It's the most diplomatic.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"Managed hours sound okay, but only if the rotation is strictly enforced. No ""volunteering"" that turns into a permanent job.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"Option A is acceptable, provided the ""supervision"" is a shared duty and doesn't just excuse the current host's privilege.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,"I still think the moving one is an adventure! But if everyone hates it, I'll pick the hours!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm torn. The enclosure is the most permanent, but the cost is a real concern for some. I'll go with the hours.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Option A is the only one that doesn't invite a new war. Let's be rational and choose the path of least resistance.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,"I've seen the time it takes. Fifty minutes is a lot, but if it's a strict rotation, it's fair. I'm voting A.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Option C is too static and ignores the current unfairness. Option A is the only viable compromise that shares the labor.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,Okay! Let's do the hours! I can use a stopwatch to see who is the fastest supervisor!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we found a middle ground that doesn't put too much financial pressure on anyone.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,A rare moment of consensus. Let's hope this actually keeps the peace for more than a month.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,"Just remember, if I'm not the one answering the phone, I'm not the one doing the scheduling!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Asuka,,"As long as the rotation is documented and the burden is equal, I am satisfied.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
